@startuml
title Activity 03 - New Payee Setup (validation-first style)
start
|CustomerApp|
:Enter BENEFICIARY details;
|PayeeAPI|
:Normalize and validate fields;
if (Format valid?) then (yes)
  :Proceed with verification;
else (no)
  :Return field-level errors;
  stop
endif
|Directory|
:Resolve destination bank/account metadata;
|Validation|
:Check ownership and account status;
if (Ownership verified?) then (yes)
  :Create BENEFICIARY status=PENDING;
else (no)
  :Reject payee setup;
  stop
endif
|Risk|
:Evaluate risk and velocity profile;
if (High risk?) then (yes)
  :Route to manual review queue;
  stop
else (no)
  :Start SCA challenge;
endif
|CustomerApp|
:Approve SCA challenge;
|PayeeAPI|
:Activate BENEFICIARY status=ACTIVE;
fork
|PayeeAPI|
:Assign default transfer limits;
fork again
|NotificationService|
:Send payee activation message;
fork again
|Risk|
:Write control/audit evidence;
end fork
stop
@enduml
